---
// CalourosRotina.astro - Sub-view 2: Linha do Tempo da Noite & Transporte
import { asset } from '../../lib/paths';
---

<div class="space-y-4 text-[#0A0A0A]">
  <!-- Linha do Tempo Noturna -->
  <div class="cagp-tool-box p-4 space-y-3">
    <div class="border-b border-[#DFDBD2] pb-2.5 flex items-center justify-between flex-wrap gap-2">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <i class="bi bi-clock-history text-[#8B1E2D] text-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <h3 class="font-['Oswald'] text-base font-bold uppercase text-[#0A0A0A]">
            Cronograma da Rotina Noturna (17h30 às 22h45)
          </h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-0.5">Horários operacionais essenciais para quem estuda à noite na Pampulha:</p>
      </div>
      <span class="cagp-badge cagp-badge-dark font-mono">
        <i class="bi bi-moon-stars" aria-hidden="true"></i> Turno Noturno
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-2 text-xs">
      <div class="cagp-card flex items-start gap-3 p-3 bg-white">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-[4px] bg-[#F7F5F0] border border-[#DFDBD2] flex items-center justify-center text-[#8B1E2D] shrink-0 shadow-[1px_1px_0_#0A0A0A]">
          <i class="bi bi-cup-hot-fill text-base" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="font-mono font-bold text-xs text-[#8B1E2D]">17h30</span>
            <span class="font-['Oswald'] font-bold uppercase text-[#0A0A0A]">Abertura do RU II Setorial</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-0.5">Início do jantar subsidiado aos fundos da FAFICH (próximo à FACE e ECI).</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cagp-card flex items-start gap-3 p-3 bg-[#FDF8F8] border-2 border-[#8B1E2D] shadow-[2px_2px_0_#8B1E2D]">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-[4px] bg-[#8B1E2D] text-white flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 shadow-[1px_1px_0_#0A0A0A]">
          <i class="bi bi-star-fill text-sm" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap">
            <span class="font-mono font-bold text-xs text-[#8B1E2D]">18h15</span>
            <span class="font-['Oswald'] font-bold uppercase text-[#8B1E2D]">Horário de Ouro para Jantar</span>
            <span class="cagp-badge cagp-badge-red text-xs">Dica Veterana</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-700 mt-0.5">Chegar entre 18h15 e 18h30 evita filas longas e garante entrada pontual na aula.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cagp-card flex items-start gap-3 p-3 bg-white">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-[4px] bg-[#F7F5F0] border border-[#DFDBD2] flex items-center justify-center text-[#0A0A0A] shrink-0 shadow-[1px_1px_0_#0A0A0A]">
          <i class="bi bi-book-half text-base" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="font-mono font-bold text-xs text-[#0A0A0A]">19h00</span>
            <span class="font-['Oswald'] font-bold uppercase text-[#0A0A0A]">Início das Aulas (Bloco 1)</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-0.5">Início das disciplinas nas salas do 2º e 3º andares da FAFICH.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cagp-card flex items-start gap-3 p-3 bg-white">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-[4px] bg-[#F7F5F0] border border-[#DFDBD2] flex items-center justify-center text-[#0A0A0A] shrink-0 shadow-[1px_1px_0_#0A0A0A]">
          <i class="bi bi-chat-dots-fill text-base" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="font-mono font-bold text-xs text-[#0A0A0A]">20h40</span>
            <span class="font-['Oswald'] font-bold uppercase text-[#0A0A0A]">Intervalo Acadêmico (20 min)</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-0.5">Convivência no Vão da FAFICH, Diretório Acadêmico e cantinas do prédio.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cagp-card flex items-start gap-3 p-3 bg-white">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-[4px] bg-[#F7F5F0] border border-[#DFDBD2] flex items-center justify-center text-[#0A0A0A] shrink-0 shadow-[1px_1px_0_#0A0A0A]">
          <i class="bi bi-laptop text-base" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="font-mono font-bold text-xs text-[#0A0A0A]">21h00</span>
            <span class="font-['Oswald'] font-bold uppercase text-[#0A0A0A]">Bloco 2 de Aulas</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-0.5">Continuidade dos seminários teóricos e oficinas práticas em laboratório.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cagp-card flex items-start gap-3 p-3 bg-[#FEF2F2] border-2 border-[#DC2626] shadow-[2px_2px_0_#DC2626]">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-[4px] bg-[#DC2626] text-white flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 shadow-[1px_1px_0_#0A0A0A]">
          <i class="bi bi-bus-front-fill text-base" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap">
            <span class="font-mono font-bold text-xs text-[#DC2626]">22h45</span>
            <span class="font-['Oswald'] font-bold uppercase text-[#DC2626]">Última Saída do Circular Interno</span>
            <span class="cagp-badge cagp-badge-red text-xs">Atenção Crítica</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-700 mt-0.5">Último ônibus gratuito saindo do ponto da FAFICH em direção à Portaria Carlos Luz e Estação Pampulha.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Transporte Externo -->
  <div class="cagp-tool-box p-4 space-y-3 text-xs">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-[#DFDBD2] pb-2">
      <i class="bi bi-signpost-2-fill text-[#8B1E2D] text-base" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      <h3 class="font-['Oswald'] font-bold text-sm uppercase text-[#0A0A0A]">
        Linhas de Ônibus Externas de Belo Horizonte
      </h3>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-xs text-gray-700">
      <div class="cagp-card p-3 bg-white flex items-start gap-2.5">
        <i class="bi bi-bus-front text-[#8B1E2D] text-lg shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <div>
          <strong class="font-['Oswald'] uppercase text-xs block text-[#0A0A0A]">Linha 5102 (UFMG / Savassi)</strong>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-0.5">Atravessa o campus até a Reitoria e segue pela Av. Antônio Carlos, Centro e Praça da Liberdade.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cagp-card p-3 bg-white flex items-start gap-2.5">
        <i class="bi bi-train-front text-[#0A0A0A] text-lg shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <div>
          <strong class="font-['Oswald'] uppercase text-xs block text-[#0A0A0A]">Estação Pampulha (MOVE)</strong>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-0.5">Acesso facilitado pelas linhas circulares gratuitas da UFMG até a estação de integração metropolitana.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Mapa Oficial do Campus Pampulha -->
  <div class="cagp-tool-box p-4 space-y-3 text-xs">
    <div class="border-b border-[#DFDBD2] pb-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-2 flex-wrap">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <i class="bi bi-map-fill text-[#8B1E2D] text-base" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <h3 class="font-['Oswald'] font-bold text-sm uppercase text-[#0A0A0A]">
            Mapa Oficial do Campus Pampulha da UFMG
          </h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-0.5">Localização da FAFICH, Restaurantes Universitários (RU I e II), CAD 2 e vias dos Circulares:</p>
      </div>
      <a
        href={asset('/imagens/mapa-pampulha-detalhado.jpg')}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="cagp-btn-secondary text-xs py-1.5 px-3 no-underline shrink-0 flex items-center gap-1.5"
      >
        <i class="bi bi-arrows-fullscreen"></i> Alta Resolução
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-[6px] border-2 border-[#0A0A0A] shadow-[2px_2px_0px_#0A0A0A] overflow-hidden bg-[#0A0A0A]">
      <img
        src={asset('/imagens/mapa-pampulha-detalhado.jpg')}
        alt="Mapa detalhado do Campus Pampulha da UFMG destacando FAFICH, CAD 2, Restaurantes Universitários I e II e portarias"
        class="w-full h-auto max-h-[460px] object-cover"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>
    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 italic text-center">
      Campus Pampulha — Av. Pres. Antônio Carlos, 6627. Destaque para o Setor de Humanidades (FAFICH, FACE, FALE, ECI) e o RU II Setorial.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
